ull Changelog**: https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-qdirstat/compare/2.0-ls7...2.0.1-ls8","upstream":"# Overview\r\n\r\nThe QDirStat project proudly presents its latest release: QDirStat 2.0.1.\r\n\r\nThis is a stable release.\r\n\r\n\r\n# Changes\r\n\r\n- Now changing to a safe _restricted_ mode when the user selects items in the tree or in the treemap too casually with Shift-Click or Control-Click while one of the parent items is still selected:\r\n\r\n  - Switching to single selection mode.\r\n  - Disabling _destructive_ cleanup actions like deleting directly or moving to trash.\r\n\r\n  This mode is in effect for the current program run. After restarting QDirStat, everything is back to normal.\r\n\r\n  **Background:** Several users had complained that they had accidentially deleted their home directory.\r\n  Deeper investigation strongly suggested that they had _started_ their selection with Control-Click or Shift-Click\r\n  while the toplevel item (usually the home directory) was still selected.\r\n\r\n  Rather than imposing drastic restrictions on all users who do manage to click responsibly, those users who\r\n  click too casually now are reminded how to do it correctly.\r\n\r\n- Several small fixes for MacOS compatibility. They should all be live already in the Mac version.\r\n\r\nFor more details, see the complete [change log](https://github.com/shundhammer/qdirstat/blob/master/package/opensuse/qdirstat-stable/qdirstat.changes).\r\n\r\n\r\n","upstream_url":"https://github.com/shundhammer/qdirstat/releases/tag/2.0.1"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","HOME=/config","LANGUAGE=en_US.UTF-8","LANG=en_US.UTF-8","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","DISPLAY=:1","PERL5LIB=/usr/local/bin","START_DOCKER=true","PULSE_RUNTIME_PATH=/defaults","SELKIES_INTERPOSER=/usr/lib/selkies_input_interposer.so","SELKIES_WEBCAM_INTERPOSER=/usr/lib/selkies_v4l2_interposer.so","NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=all","DISABLE_DRI3=false","SELKIES_ENCODER=h264enc,h265enc,vp8enc,vp9enc,av1enc,jpeg","SELKIES_ENABLE_BASIC_AUTH=false","SELKIES_VIDEO_STREAMING_MODE=false","SELKIES_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=*","SELKIES_RATE_CONTROL_MODE=crf,cbr","SHELL=/bin/bash","__GL_SYNC_TO_VBLANK=0","TITLE=QDirStat","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true","NO_GAMEPAD=true","PIXELFLUX_WAYLAND=true"],"exposed_ports":["3000/tcp","3001/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/qdirstat/builds/2.0.1-ls8.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/qdirstat/builds/2.0.1-ls8/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/qdirstat/builds/2.0.1-ls8/layers.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/qdirstat/builds/2.0.1-ls8/layers.arm64.json"},"packages":{},"release":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-qdirstat/releases/tag/2.0.1-ls8","pages":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-qdirstat/builds/2.0.1-ls8/","files":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-qdirstat/builds/2.0.1-ls8/files.amd64.json.gz","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-qdirstat/builds/2.0.1-ls8/files.arm64.json.gz"},"sbom":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-qdirstat/builds/2.0.1-ls8/packages.amd64.json.gz","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-qdirstat/builds/2.0.1-ls8/packages.arm64.json.gz"},"run_json":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-qdirstat/releases/download/2.0.1-ls8/run.json","logs_zip":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-qdirstat/releases/download/2.0.1-ls8/logs.zip","test_report":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/site/images/qdirstat/builds/2.0.1-ls8/","tests":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hu